/*
** HollyTrek -- Super Star Trek, Hollywood edition
**
** A graphical port of the BBS door version 1.1.0 of Tom Almy's
** "Super Star Trek" (C), based on the 1978 classic.
** Original sources: https://github.com/fstltna/SuperStarTrek
**
** Built with SCORE, CLOAKING and CAPTURE enabled, like the
** original makefile.
**
** Run:   Hollywood sst.hws
** Needs: sst.doc in the same directory for the HELP command.
*/

@APPTITLE "HollyTrek"
@DISPLAY {Title = "HollyTrek - Super Star Trek", Width = 1024, Height = 768, Color = $000000}

